📊 VII. STRATEGIC OBJECTIVE — EPOCH IP STACK (Target State)

Epoch IP Stack will merge all current and future vaults into a unified Behavioral-Legal-Technical Sovereign Framework where:

Every creative or computational act produces a Mint Unit™.

Each Mint Unit records its lifecycle to the Logic Provenance Ledger (LPL).

The RBGA monitors and governs behavior through Reflexive Audits.

All jurisdictional and licensing events route through Eliam Sovereign Infrastructure™.

Public releases timestamp into the Unified Notice Record Chain (UNRC).

Result:

A self-governing, self-auditing, sovereign intellectual property ecosystem — the foundation for epochal IP governance.

